the SDK+framework pin (ADR-015-3) — see `RUNBOOK.md` §1.","+"," ## Versioning"," "," `VERSION` is bumped by CI at merge — PRs never touch it. Each PR adds one"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
