{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CfXLxj165h3kwgpBhg8ge","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PzGvZQ2eSvNv1TpyPTVJVS","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/shane/Projects/k-12Harness/RUNBOOK.md","old_string":"## 0. Baseline (30 seconds, no credential)\n\n```bash\nbash setup.sh\n.venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/ -q\n.venv/bin/python demo.py --replay\n```\n\nExpected: the suite green, and the demo walking eight steps ending\n`8 steps · 8 as scripted · no spend recorded`. If either fails, stop — nothing\nbelow is meaningful on a broken baseline.","new_string":"## 0. Baseline (30 seconds, no credential)\n\nThis is the **deterministic tier**: pytest against the stub emitter, zero network,\ngating every PR (ADR-007).\n\n```bash\nbash setup.sh\n.venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/ -q\n.venv/bin/python demo.py --replay\n```\n\nExpected: the suite green, and the demo walking eight steps ending\n`8 steps · 8 as scripted · no spend recorded`. If either fails, stop — nothing\nbelow is meaningful on a broken baseline.\n\n`--replay` is one of the demo's three modes (ADR-017), each announced by a tested\nbanner printed before the first step and again after the last: `--replay` (decisions\nreplayed from reference solutions — no model, no cost, all fixtures), `--stub` (a real\nmodel, canned envelopes), and neither flag (real model, real emitter — the only mode\nwhere a number on screen is a claim about a school). See §1 below for `--stub` and the\nlive run."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1245,"cache_read_input_tokens":53406,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1245},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"